ure","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dotted","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1952963040,"version":1,"versionNonce":1445079138,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"e48","type":"text","x":128.0,"y":148.0,"width":105.60000000000001,"height":60.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2f9e44","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1767236608,"version":1,"versionNonce":880109555,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"beta:\n< 15 testers\n\u2248 $10\u2013150/mo","originalText":"beta:\n< 15 testers\n\u2248 $10\u2013150/mo","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true},{"id":"e49","type":"text","x":120,"y":710,"width":1037.8500000000001,"height":106.25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1167824149,"version":1,"versionNonce":187456965,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"1. Serverless cost is mostly idle time, not GPU-seconds: 5 GPU-s per dictation costs only ~5\u201310% more than 2.\n2. Keep the idle window short (10 s) and hide the cold start by warming the server when the app session starts.\n3. Switch to always-on when the serverless bill passes the cheapest always-on GPU (~25\u201345 daily users),\n    or when the server is up more than ~6 h a day. Always-on also removes cold-start waits.\n4. Cloud Run bills ~10 min idle per wake-up, so even 1 tester costs ~$130/mo: wrong tool for a small beta.","originalText":"1. Serverless cost is mostly idle time, not GPU-seconds: 5 GPU-s per dictation costs only ~5\u201310% more than 2.\n2. Keep the idle window short (10 s) and hide the cold start by warming the server when the app session starts.\n3. Switch to always-on when the serverless bill passes the cheapest always-on GPU (~25\u201345 daily users),\n    or when the server is up more than ~6 h a day. Always-on also removes cold-start waits.\n4. Cloud Run bills ~10 min idle per wake-up, so even 1 tester costs ~$130/mo: wrong tool for a small beta.","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":true}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","gridSize":null},"files":{}}